flowchart TD
    A[User Input in Streamlit UI] --> B[Input Guardrail\nvalidate question length/non-empty]
    B --> C[Build Pet Context\nowner + tasks + schedule + skipped reasons]
    C --> D{Provider Router\nAI_PROVIDER + failover}

    D --> E1[Gemini API]
    D --> E2[OpenAI API]
    D --> E3[Claude API]

    E1 --> F[Candidate Answer]
    E2 --> F
    E3 --> F

    F --> G{Output Reliability Check\nGrounded task titles + required fields\ntime/place/priority/duration}
    G -- pass --> H[Render AI answer]
    G -- fail --> I[Local deterministic fallback\nScheduler-based summary]

    D -->|all providers fail| I
    I --> J[Render fallback + reasons]
    H --> K[Visible telemetry\nprovider + latency + attempt trail]
    J --> K
